{"id":"vod_md_5452","vodId":"5452","provider":"md","providerName":"魔都动漫","type":2,"name":"狩龙人拉格纳","name_cn":"狩龙人拉格纳","date":"2023-01-01","year":"2023","region":"jp","area":"日本","platform":"日韩动漫","remarks":"24集全","images":{"common":"https://www.mdzypic.com/upload/vod/20231002-1/1b60cb6e5e4964b80ae540ab5bb06ef8.jpg"},"summary":"“狩龙人”是挥舞银剑将龙猎杀并获取报酬的职业。武艺不精的狩龙人少年·拉格纳和狩龙数遥遥领先其他人的天才少女·蕾欧妮卡组成搭档，日复一日地讨伐着龙。拉格纳的心愿只有一个——“不变强也没关系，只想一直待在蕾欧身边”。然而，在远比之前遇到的龙强大的“高位龙”的袭击之下，他的梦想化为泡影。在强大敌人的面前，拉格纳脑中闪过近日困扰他的噩梦——那是虽然获得了最强的力量却无人可以保护，行走于绝望孤独的未来的自己。未来的自己诉说了什么？现在的自己应该选择哪条路？随后，拉格纳与谜团重重的新搭档·绯红一起，为回避绝望的未来踏出了第一步。挑战绝对的强者，反抗强制的命运，突破极限——超克己主义异世界极限战斗！！","rating":{"score":0},"tags":[{"name":"动画"}],"sourceType":"third-party","updatedAt":"2024-04-01 02:05:44","episodeCount":24,"playable":true,"playGroups":[{"name":"modum3u8","episodes":[{"name":"第1集","url":"https://play.modujx10.com/20231001/7KS47jV4/index.m3u8"},{"name":"第2集","url":"https://play.modujx10.com/20231008/Jyh3WTOS/index.m3u8"},{"name":"第3集","url":"https://play.modujx10.com/20231015/VxTVBKXH/index.m3u8"},{"name":"第4集","url":"https://play.modujx10.com/20231023/40FtKBNN/index.m3u8"},{"name":"第5集","url":"https://play.modujx10.com/20231030/qTrYoNz9/index.m3u8"},{"name":"第6集","url":"https://play.modujx10.com/20231107/KW3eGim7/index.m3u8"},{"name":"第7集","url":"https://play.modujx10.com/20231112/IrnDMXbG/index.m3u8"},{"name":"第8集","url":"https://play.modujx10.com/20231119/Lgb3XB34/index.m3u8"},{"name":"第9集","url":"https://play.modujx10.com/20231125/wlDwqjsH/index.m3u8"},{"name":"第10集","url":"https://play.modujx10.com/20231203/qq211ZUB/index.m3u8"},{"name":"第11集","url":"https://play.modujx10.com/20231209/XGFGzn0w/index.m3u8"},{"name":"第12集","url":"https://play.modujx10.com/20231217/ZufXtsPq/index.m3u8"},{"name":"第13集","url":"https://play.modujx10.com/20240114/ZV5gr5Cb/index.m3u8"},{"name":"第14集","url":"https://play.modujx10.com/20240121/6RwsVJfp/index.m3u8"},{"name":"第15集","url":"https://play.modujx10.com/20240128/osfEo70s/index.m3u8"},{"name":"第16集